    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26857" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">līvesco</span></b> , ĕre,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. n., to turn
				black and blue, become livid</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">digiti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					3, 528</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 181</span></i>.—*
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to envy, be
			envious</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nec enim livescere fas est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. Rapt. Pros. 3, 27</span></i>
			.</div>
